mh2lm: stage TouchComm TLMM GPIO122 IRQ on GIC SPI 208 (0137)

The current TouchComm worker polls ATTN every 10 ms. Keep that as the
default; sweettouchirq=1 probes the TLMM summary SPI using bounded GIC
software pending with GPIO122 interrupt disabled, and mode 2 enables
level-low GPIO122 after the probe. The IRQ top half masks SPI 240 and
wakes the existing touch worker, which reads TouchComm, clears the TLMM
status, and rearms the SPI. A 200 ms ATTN recovery check and bounded
fault thresholds restore the old 10 ms poller.

